# sweep: --bare
# A first run is a plain row counter with no pattern on the reader yet.
wait-for Row counter
expect Row 0
expect Send one from your computer
clean
shot first-run
tap Read a pattern
wait-for No patterns yet
expect kobo needles push PATTERN.pdf
expect Check for patterns
clean
shot no-patterns
tap Check for patterns
wait-for No patterns yet
companion needles push apps/needles/fixtures/pattern.md --sim
tap Check for patterns
wait-for Winter socks
clean
shot first-pattern
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Row counter
expect Winter socks
